# New article metadata

When adding a listed article, complete all of the following.

## 1. `lib/articles.ts`

Add an `ArticleMeta` entry (near the top for new featured work):

- `slug`, `title`, `description`, `author`, `date`, `excerpt`
- `listed: true`, `hasComments: true` (unless intentionally unlisted)
- `image` / `imageAlt` when a feature image exists

## 2. `app/articles/<slug>/page.tsx` Next.js `metadata`

Export full `Metadata` matching existing articles (e.g. neo-malayalam-karshon):

- `title`, `description`, `keywords`, `authors`, `creator`, `publisher`, `category`
- `openGraph`: `type: "article"`, canonical `url`, `siteName: "Hendo Academy"`, `locale: "en_IN"`, `publishedTime`, `authors`, `section`, `tags`
- `openGraph.images` / Twitter `summary_large_image` when there is a feature image; otherwise Twitter `summary`
- `alternates.canonical`: `https://www.hendoacademy.org/articles/<slug>`
- `robots`: `{ index: true, follow: true }`

Load listing fields via `getArticle(slug)` with a fallback object.

## 3. Hyphens

Use plain hyphens (`-`) only - never em or en dashes - in titles, descriptions, excerpts, and tags.
